{"id":"92c4449a6fa3b997","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties.md","title":"Closure Properties of Maximal Consistent Sets","display":"lem-maximal-consistent-properties — Closure Properties of Maximal Consistent Sets","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties","aliases":["89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-maximal-consistent-properties — Closure Properties of Maximal Consistent Sets","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","[[89-df-local-modal-consequence]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-maximal-consistent-properties — Closure Properties of Maximal Consistent Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38f802289559e5da\" href=\"?note=38f802289559e5da\" title=\"89-df-modal-consistent-set\">89-df-modal-consistent-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"413ee4c6aedeb326\" href=\"?note=413ee4c6aedeb326\" title=\"89-df-local-modal-consequence\">89-df-local-modal-consequence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\">\\(\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}\\)</span> 使用有限局部后果；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 包含空合取。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;L\\subseteq\\Gamma,\\quad\\bot\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow A\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;A\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\in\\Gamma\\land B\\in\\Gamma),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Delta)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta)\\to\\Delta=\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;L\\subseteq\\Gamma,\\quad\\bot\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow A\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;A\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\in\\Gamma\\land B\\in\\Gamma),\\\\\n&amp;\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Delta)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta)\\to\\Delta=\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 85–87；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>完备性至少选取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\neg A\">\\(A,\\neg A\\)</span> 中之一；若两者都在集合里，二元素合取的否定是重言式，违反一致性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是有限局部后果而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\notin\\Gamma\">\\(A\\notin\\Gamma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，与见证合并给出有限反驳；反向取单元素见证。空见证给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>，并推出合取、MP 闭包。最后，任何真扩张添加某个不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 已包含其否定，所以不一致。不能由这些闭包推出局部成员的必然化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-consistent-set","status":"resolved","id":"38f802289559e5da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-local-modal-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"413ee4c6aedeb326","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-local-modal-consequence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MCS}_L(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}consistent\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&L\\subseteq\\Gamma,\\quad\\bot\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&\\neg A\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow A\\notin\\Gamma,\\\\\n&A\\land B\\in\\Gamma\\Longleftrightarrow(A\\in\\Gamma\\land B\\in\\Gamma),\\\\\n&\\Gamma\\vdash_L^{\\mathrm{loc}}A\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\Gamma,\\\\\n&\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n((\\mathrm{Con}_L(\\Delta)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta)\\to\\Delta=\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A,\\neg A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\notin\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1741,"backlinks":[{"id":"f530ad4c65761317","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4f2c4a3e09c03374","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5ba20ee86fa7998c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a668d880013388bd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5bc3d5ff97b8f74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-consistent-set]] → [[89-df-local-modal-consequence]] → [[89-lem-local-modal-deduction]] → [[89-lem-maximal-consistent-properties]] → [[89-lem-lindenbaum-modal]] → [[89-df-canonical-model]] → [[89-lem-canonical-successor]] → [[89-lem-canonical-truth]] → [[89-thm-canonical-model]]"}],"outgoing":["38f802289559e5da","413ee4c6aedeb326"]}